{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t立法會大會，有議員關注政府向引進香港的海內外企業提供政策優惠時，會否要求聘用一定比例的本地僱員。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n商務及經濟發展局局長丘應樺表示，引進到香港的企業，大多聘用本地僱員，但現階段無規定聘用比例，如果在商討時企業能作出相關承諾，可以成為提供優惠的談判籌碼。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.011187+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:51:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:46.789825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:49.045851+00:00","content_hash":"1014e363b56fb5688e2e4dd80ea025425af351fac8c3242dc7767f42e52a1858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}